course: dictionary
lesson: 7278
title: Pineapple: not an apple, not from a pine
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: Some words sound like they mean one thing but do not. Read the clues around the word. «A pineapple grows one at a time from the middle of a low spiky plant.» The clues are low, spiky plant and middle, so a pineapple is not a tree. It is not from a pine tree, even though the name sounds like one.
explain: Clues also tell you what a pineapple looks like. «A pineapple is a hundred or more tiny flowers grown together.» Many small parts joined into one bigger thing is a clue that the fruit is made of lots of little fruits, not one smooth ball. Check your idea by putting it into the sentence: does it still make sense?
explain: The same fruit can be eaten in different ways. «Fresh pineapple stops jelly setting,» but «tinned pineapple has been heated» and so the jelly does set. Fresh, tinned and on pizza are all still pineapple. The word names the fruit, however it is cooked or served.
fact: A pineapple is a large tropical fruit with rough, spiky brown skin and sweet, juicy yellow flesh.
fact: The crown on top of a pineapple is a bunch of stiff green leaves.
fact: Pineapples grow on low plants in hot countries, not on trees.
fact: Each pineapple is made of many small fruits joined together.
fact: Pineapple is still pineapple when it is fresh, in juice, in tins or on pizza.
exercise: «A pineapple grows one at a time from the middle of a low spiky plant.» What kind of plant does a pineapple grow on? | A big apple tree | A seaweed bed | A tall pine tree | *A low spiky plant
exercise: What is on top of a pineapple? | *A crown of stiff green leaves | Thin yellow skin | Soft pink petals | A ring of brown seeds
exercise: What is a pineapple? | A sort of pizza | A cold drink | A kind of pine tree | *A large tropical fruit with spiky skin
test: Where do pineapples grow? | Cold countries | *Hot countries | Under the sea | In cities
test: What colour is the inside of a pineapple? | White | *Yellow | Red | Blue
exam: «A pineapple is a hundred or more tiny flowers grown together.» What does this tell us? | It is a kind of nut | It grows underground | *It is made of many small parts joined together | It is one tiny flower
